  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole adult animal: robust early sauropodomorph hindquarters and relatively shortened forequarters. Not hatchling, partial skeleton or a recoloured Massospondylus.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Original living reconstruction based on a published adult composite, not a complete single skeleton. Adult skull is missing; Otero2019 used a scaled Plateosaurus skull and restored missing tail parts with Plateosaurus. Our conservative head and tail are likewise inferred, not direct Mussaurus adult cranial evidence. Scale and soft tissue are approximate.\",\"zh\":\"依据已发表成年合成骨架制作完整活体美术复原，并非完整单一标本。成年头骨未保存，2019研究借用等比例板龙头骨并补配尾部；本作头尾缺失部分同样属于推断，不称作鼠龙成年头骨实证。尺度和软组织为估计。\"},\"inventory_ordinal\":345,\"name\":{\"en\":\"Mussaurus\",\"zh\":\"鼠龙\"},\"taxon\":\"Mussaurus patagonicus\",\"classification\":\"Dinosauria, Saurischia, Sauropodomorpha\",\"scale\":{\"total_length_m\":5.5,\"basis\":\"Approximate display length estimated from Figure1d adult reconstruction and its100cm bar; not a fossil total-length measurement. Published adult femur0.726m supplies independent proportion anchor.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Deep robust ribcage and substantial pelvis/upper thighs, not the slender neck-dominated Massospondylus body.\",\"Short free forelimbs contrasted with robust longer hindlimbs in adult bipedal stance; no hatchling quadrupedal proportions.\",\"Substantial muscular tail base with long tapering tail; tail bulk integral to adult silhouette.\",\"Moderately long neck and small conservative head, no invented cranial crest or oversized embryo skull.\",\"Grasping hands facing inward, not load-bearing columnar sauropod forefeet.\"],\"specimen_basis\":\"Otero etal2019 Figure1d actual adult fossil elements and gray-preserved-bone reconstruction personally inspected. Composite MLP68-II-27-1, MLP60-III-20-22, MLP61-III-20-23. Different-age panels a-c are not adult reference.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole adult animal: robust early sauropodomorph hindquarters and relatively shortened forequarters. Not hatchling, partial skeleton or a recoloured Massospondylus.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Original living reconstruction based on a published adult composite, not a complete single skeleton. Adult skull is missing; Otero2019 used a scaled Plateosaurus skull and restored missing tail parts with Plateosaurus. Our conservative head and tail are likewise inferred, not direct Mussaurus adult cranial evidence. Scale and soft tissue are approximate.\",\"zh\":\"依据已发表成年合成骨架制作完整活体美术复原，并非完整单一标本。成年头骨未保存，2019研究借用等比例板龙头骨并补配尾部；本作头尾缺失部分同样属于推断，不称作鼠龙成年头骨实证。尺度和软组织为估计。\"},\"inventory_ordinal\":345,\"name\":{\"en\":\"Mussaurus\",\"zh\":\"鼠龙\"},\"taxon\":\"Mussaurus patagonicus\",\"classification\":\"Dinosauria, Saurischia, Sauropodomorpha\",\"scale\":{\"total_length_m\":5.5,\"basis\":\"Approximate display length estimated from Figure1d adult reconstruction and its100cm bar; not a fossil total-length measurement. Published adult femur0.726m supplies independent proportion anchor.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Deep robust ribcage and substantial pelvis/upper thighs, not the slender neck-dominated Massospondylus body.\",\"Short free forelimbs contrasted with robust longer hindlimbs in adult bipedal stance; no hatchling quadrupedal proportions.\",\"Substantial muscular tail base with long tapering tail; tail bulk integral to adult silhouette.\",\"Moderately long neck and small conservative head, no invented cranial crest or oversized embryo skull.\",\"Grasping hands facing inward, not load-bearing columnar sauropod forefeet.\"],\"specimen_basis\":\"Otero etal2019 Figure1d actual adult fossil elements and gray-preserved-bone reconstruction personally inspected. Composite MLP68-II-27-1, MLP60-III-20-22, MLP61-III-20-23. Different-age panels a-c are not adult reference.\"}"
  },
